Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Phase 6/7/8 scripts + phase-notes for Phases 4-7, blocked
 on GPU compute

Phase 6 (scripts/train_tgfem.py): full training script built on
TGFEMTrainer, covering all three Phase 5 model variants (tgfem,
tgfem_identity for ablation (a), cbam_worlddetect for ablation (g)).
Evaluates on the held-out TEST split via a fresh DetectionValidator, not
the val split Ultralytics reports during training (Phase 3's own finding,
reapplied). Smoke-tested end to end on CPU/toy scale - trains, evaluates
on the right split, writes results/phase6_*.json in Phase 3's schema.

Phase 7:
- scripts/run_ablations.py: resumable dispatcher over train_tgfem.py
  covering the three priority ablations (a, d, g) first.
- scripts/eval_tgfem.py: re-verifies the Phase 3 negative-control bug
  (WorldValidator silently overriding prompts) doesn't resurface here -
  loads a trained checkpoint, swaps in absurd prompts without retraining,
  confirms mAP collapses; plus a cross-variant comparison table with the
  falsifiable per-class prediction from PHASE-3.md (TG-FEM's gain over
  CBAM should concentrate on crazing/rolled-in_scale).

Phase 8 (scripts/demo.py): text-query inference on a trained checkpoint -
type any free-text description (not limited to the training corpus) and
get boxes back. Reuses the checkpoint's LEARNED context tokens (CoOp's
whole point) while swapping in new query text at inference time. Required
one fix beyond what Phase 5 already covered: WorldDetect derives
self.no = nc + reg_max*4 from self.nc, which must be updated explicitly
when the query count changes (mirrors WorldModel.set_classes()). Smoke-
tested end to end: arbitrary phrases produce boxes correctly.

phase-notes/PHASE-4.md through PHASE-7.md: full write-ups per this
project's established format (what was done, what was verified, what's
carried forward), each explicit about the same two sandbox constraints:
no GPU here, and no route to huggingface.co, so every check performed is
structural (shapes/gradients/checkpointing), never an accuracy claim.
README's build-phases table updated to reflect this - Phases 4/5 done and
verified, Phases 6/7/8 scripted and smoke-tested but blocked on compute.

src/tgfem/data.py: added class_texts_for()/load_corpus() helpers so
training and eval scripts can never pick different phrases for the same
class-index slot.
